1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,170
(Sheldon:)In.

2
00:00:03,270 --> 00:00:04,340
(Sheldon:)Let me guess.

3
00:00:04,505 --> 00:00:06,175
(Voice:)And out.

4
00:00:07,608 --> 00:00:09,648
(Sheldon:)What was I gonna do?
Two "ins" in a row?

5
00:00:14,615 --> 00:00:17,185
(Sheldon:)-Where's my lemonade?
-I didn't get it.

6
00:00:17,351 --> 00:00:20,351
(Sheldon:)A fitting swan song
to your career as a waitress

7
00:00:20,521 --> 00:00:23,191
(Sheldon:)to forget my order one last time.

8
00:00:29,363 --> 00:00:31,863
(Penny:)Do you think quitting
my job was a mistake?

9
00:00:32,867 --> 00:00:34,867
(Sheldon:)Do you see me drinking lemonade?

10
00:00:36,003 --> 00:00:37,383
(Penny:)No. I'm serious.

11
00:00:38,305 --> 00:00:39,715
(Sheldon:)Why do you ask?

12
00:00:39,874 --> 00:00:42,444
(Penny:)Because Leonard just pissed me off.

13
00:00:42,610 --> 00:00:44,060
(Penny:)Am I being an idiot or not?

14
00:00:44,211 --> 00:00:46,521
(Sheldon:)No, I don't think you are.

15
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:48,060
(Stuart:)Really?

16
00:00:48,549 --> 00:00:51,529
(Sheldon:)The best way to achieve
a goal is to devote 100 percent

17
00:00:51,685 --> 00:00:53,665
(Sheldon:)of your time and energy to it.

18
00:00:53,888 --> 00:00:55,338
(Sheldon:)When I decided I was
going to be a physicist,

19
00:00:55,489 --> 00:00:58,729
(Sheldon:)I didn't take some other job
in case it didn't work out.

20
00:00:58,893 --> 00:01:01,023
(Sheldon:)Which wasn't easy because
there was a lot of pressure

